# Repository structure

**Templates:** `packages/create-content-sdk-app/src/templates/` — copied to generated apps; self-contained; `.env.*.example` for env values.

**Initializers:** `Initializer.init(args)` in `packages/create-content-sdk-app/src/initializers/`. Reuse `src/common/` processes.

**Samples:** `yarn scaffold-samples`; inside `samples/` use that app's `AGENTS.md`.

Full layout and package map: [`.agents/docs/AGENTS-repo-and-packages.md`](../../.agents/docs/AGENTS-repo-and-packages.md)
